{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他离开后才发现，最舍不得的是曾经被人当作自己人的日子，但即使回去，也不确定能否回到从前。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"怀念、失落、受伤、犹豫、不安\",\n      \"missed\": \"过去具体发生过哪些让他难受的事，以及为什么仅凭舍不得仍无法放心回去；熟悉的歌舞只剩断续碎片、明明重要却没有力气从头讲述，还有眼下日子过得不踏实，这些需要逐句读才能理解。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他怀念曾经被当作自己人的日子，却因为过去受过的伤，无法确定自己是否还能安心回去。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"怀念、空落、刺痛、疲惫、犹豫\",\n      \"missed\": \"过去的伤害具体是什么、反复思考仍没有答案，以及声音和熟悉歌舞逐渐变成碎片的细节。右侧三条小字也不容易一眼完整读到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他放不下从前被人接纳和当作自己人的日子，但过去的伤害还在，所以想回去又不敢确定能否回去。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"想念、失落、受伤、疲惫、悬而未决\",\n      \"missed\": \"当初让他难受的事不能当作没发生过，以及他已经累到连从头讲述都没有力气、连眼下的日子也过得不踏实。这些信息需要读下方长段才能获得。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"两段大字号长文字同时占据视觉中心，标题讲舍不得过去，下方又讲无法放心回去，核心需要在两块之间拼接；紫色强调虽然能快速抓到无法放心回去、仍没答案，但没有直接交代过去的伤害。副文中的歌舞和声音碎片与人物关系处境之间的联系也不够直接。下方音符动画与歌舞文字有呼应，但更多是音乐氛围，不能帮助观众直接理解人物此刻的处境。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cdd4eb01-3bd8-4b69-bfde-76e3a2696f52", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T001901244636Z", "elapsed_seconds": 72.938, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:20:14.177096+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "32e474aff58e4b44f58bf0a83cd5f35ca4d32c692124df0b882d5cb070f15a4d", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T001901244636Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "60e8e6c1fc3cdc914eb2e90737974fa6a5e16f4c0840ca819faa03d8e07c95c3"}}}
